  "cmd_name": "create-library",
  "deprecated": false,
  "description_en": "Creates a document library. A document library is used to isolate document and index information. If your scenarios require you to frequently retrieve data by category using natural language, create multiple document libraries to isolate different types of data. You can customize vector and text indexes based on formats",
  "description_zh": "创建文档库。创建一个新的文档库，文档库用作隔离文档信息、索引信息，如果使用场景中需要经常按类别去做自然语言检索，建议创建多个文档库，来隔离不同类型的数据。支持按照格式自定义向量索引和文本索引",
  "kebab_example": "aliyun dianjin create-library --workspace-id llm-ik000000RVYCKzt --region cn-hangzhou",
